{"skill":{"slug":"ddg-web-search","displayName":"DuckDuckGo Web Search"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771148054829,"changelog":"- Initial release: Adds search capability using DuckDuckGo Lite with web_fetch.\n- No API key required; works with the built-in tool and zero dependencies.\n- Returns search results with titles, URLs, and snippets for research queries.\n- Supports regional filtering via URL parameters.\n- Documents how to extract results and avoid sponsored links.\n- Designed as a fallback for missing API key errors or when no search API is configured.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1999,"sha256":"e682629ecedd2a7974a7ff3c43731aba39d26130101c559afb4d3092dc1b8ab5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1917,"sha256":"791c809cadee7cb392f2f3a08262fdca0f774adeac91434cbeef48ae443c6c37","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789068551267,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"ac2bf4bd0a83333ee85f9b4ddb6249e45ccf1f894e4af6d4c6b30b614a4f73cd","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/ac2bf4bd0a83333ee85f9b4ddb6249e45ccf1f894e4af6d4c6b30b614a4f73cd","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ddg-web-search\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle provides instructions for performing web searches using DuckDuckGo Lite via the built-in `web_fetch` tool. All instructions in `SKILL.md` are transparent, directly related to the stated purpose of web searching, and only direct the agent to interact with `https://lite.duckduckgo.com`. There is no evidence of prompt injection attempting to subvert the agent's behavior for malicious ends, nor any attempts at data exfiltration, unauthorized execution, or persistence mechanisms. The use of `web_fetch` is for a clearly defined and benign purpose.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779164213675},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789068551267},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a simple DuckDuckGo Lite search helper that discloses its network use and does not install code, persist state, or request sensitive access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"It uses outbound web_fetch requests to DuckDuckGo and user-selected result pages, which is expected for a web search skill and disclosed in the artifact.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown skill file with no executable scripts, dependencies, package installs, or install-time commands.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill gives scoped usage guidance, regional query parameters, and limitations; it does not alter agent goals, override safety rules, or ask the agent to hide behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, credential use, local file access, privilege escalation, background workers, or system modifications were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is web search via DuckDuckGo Lite using web_fetch, and the instructions are limited to forming a search URL, reading text results, and fetching selected pages.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that searches will send query terms to DuckDuckGo Lite and fetched result pages. Avoid putting secrets or private data into search queries, but the skill itself is purpose-aligned and low risk.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789068551267}}}}}